{"strongs": "H2218", "word": "זֶ֫רֶד", "translit": "ze.red", "root": "זרד", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a river", "gloss": "Wady-el-Aµsy", "definition": "זֶ֫רֶד proper name, of a river (√ dubious; on form compare Lg BN 77 ) — נַחַל זֶ֫רֶד Deut 2:13 נַחַל זָרֶ֑ד Num 21:12 ( J E ), Deut 2:13 ; Deut 2:14 identification disputed; Rob BR ii. 157 proposes Wady-el-Aµsy (= נַחַל הָעֲרָבִים Isa 15:7 ), between Moab & Edom; < either Sail Sa±îde ( Kn ), chief source of Arnon from southeast ( Burckh Syrien, 635 ), or west Kerak ( Ges Ke Di ); so also GASm Geog. 557 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2445')\">BDB2445</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2218')\">H2218</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2444')\">BDB2444</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2446')\">BDB2446</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זֶ֫רֶד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a river</b> (√ dubious; on form compare Lg<sup>BN 77</sup>) — <bdbheb>נַחַל זֶ֫רֶד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,13)\">Deut 2:13</ref> <bdbheb>נַחַל זָרֶ֑ד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,12)\">Num 21:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 2:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,13)\">Deut 2:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,14)\">Deut 2:14</ref> identification disputed; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Rob')\">Rob<sup>BR ii. 157</sup></lookup> proposes <transliteration><highlight>Wady-el-Aµsy</highlight></transliteration> (= <bdbheb>נַחַל הָעֲרָבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 15:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,7)\">Isa 15:7</ref>), between Moab &amp; Edom